  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "According to the BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\n**Option 1 :** 6 and 9\n\nGiven:\n\n384 ÷ 16 - 72 + 9 × 10 = 2\n\nAfter interchanging the digits;\n\n***__384 ÷ 19__*** - 72 + 6 × 10 = 2\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n20.21 - 72 + ***__6 × 10__*** = 2\n\n***__20.21__*** - 72 ***__+ 60__*** = 2\n\n***__80.21 – 72__*** = 2\n\n8.21 = 2 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 2 :** 4 and 8\n\nGiven:\n\n384 ÷ 16 - 72 + 9 × 10 = 2\n\nAfter interchanging the digits;\n\n***__348 ÷ 16__*** - 72 + 9 × 10 = 2\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n21.75 - 72 + ***__9 × 10__*** = 2\n\n***__21.75__*** - 72 ***__+ 90__*** = 2\n\n***__111.75 - 72__*** = 2\n\n39.75 = 2 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 3: **3 and 7\n\nGiven:\n\n384 ÷ 16 - 72 + 9 × 10 = 2\n\nAfter interchanging the digits;\n\n***__784 ÷ 16__*** - 32 + 9 × 10 = 2\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n49 - 32 + ***__9 × 10__*** = 2\n\n***__49__*** - 32 ***__+ 90__*** = 2\n\n139 - 32 = 2\n\n107 = 2 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 4: **7 and 9\n\n**Given:**\n\n**384 ÷ 16 - 72 + 9 *×* 10 = 2**\n\n**After interchanging ****the digits;**\n\n***__384 ÷ 16__* - 92 + 7 *×* 10 = 2**\n\n**By BODMAS rule**\n\n**24 - 92 + *__7 × 10__* = 2**\n\n***__24__***** – 92 + *__70__* = 2**\n\n***__94 – 92__***** = 2**\n\n**2 = 2** **(LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **“****7 and 9”.**",
